{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01263",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.19,
      "end_seconds": 5.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.51,
      "end_seconds": 11.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.88,
      "end_seconds": 23.08,
      "duration_seconds": 10.2,
      "text": "I, I wanted to get pain that started around my belly button then moved to the right looked at"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.6,
      "end_seconds": 27.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.49,
      "end_seconds": 36.97,
      "duration_seconds": 7.48,
      "text": "It's been going on for two days. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.71,
      "end_seconds": 41.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.69,
      "end_seconds": 46.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Severe, really. Oh, and no appetite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.65,
      "end_seconds": 50.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Any diarrhoea, cough or urinary symptoms at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.26,
      "end_seconds": 55.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.13,
      "end_seconds": 62.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.48,
      "end_seconds": 67.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "That's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.98,
      "end_seconds": 70.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.74,
      "end_seconds": 75.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.6,
      "end_seconds": 94.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "so, before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.92,
      "end_seconds": 98.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "No, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.52,
      "end_seconds": 117.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.86,
      "end_seconds": 135.46,
      "duration_seconds": 16.6,
      "text": "Let me think, yes, an underactive thyroid. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I've got diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.0,
      "end_seconds": 146.35,
      "duration_seconds": 10.35,
      "text": "Right, so an underactive thyroid is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.91,
      "end_seconds": 150.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "My sister had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.83,
      "end_seconds": 157.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.3,
      "end_seconds": 173.42,
      "duration_seconds": 14.12,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.07,
      "end_seconds": 179.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "which medicines do you take at the the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.14,
      "end_seconds": 191.35,
      "duration_seconds": 9.21,
      "text": "Thyroxine, 75 micrograms, every morning for my thyroid. I'm on gliclazide, 80 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.85,
      "end_seconds": 196.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "let me get the readings out of the way"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.66,
      "end_seconds": 210.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.6,
      "end_seconds": 232.02,
      "duration_seconds": 10.42,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 96 percent on room air, temperature 38.5, heart rate 90. And respiratory rate 21, blood pressure 124 over 72."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.85,
      "end_seconds": 236.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.72,
      "end_seconds": 241.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.93,
      "end_seconds": 248.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.71,
      "end_seconds": 257.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "that's alright"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.07,
      "end_seconds": 260.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.52,
      "end_seconds": 283.55,
      "duration_seconds": 7.03,
      "text": "It hurts most low on the right and it hurts when I let go of the pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.49,
      "end_seconds": 287.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.85,
      "end_seconds": 306.33,
      "duration_seconds": 13.48,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. Taking everything into account, I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be possible appendicitis, or it might be a urine infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.73,
      "end_seconds": 337.14,
      "duration_seconds": 13.41,
      "text": "I'll request an ultrasound or CT scan, it'll help with possible appendicitis. You need to go to hospital now and not eat or drink. Come back straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.14,
      "end_seconds": 340.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "so, good, I'll return then"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.17,
      "end_seconds": 344.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.48,
      "end_seconds": 349.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.28,
      "end_seconds": 353.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "so, have a good day"
    }
  ]
}